---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CouchFooter from '../components/CouchFooter.astro';
const updated = "October 2026";
---
<Base title="Now" description="What Anthony Catanese is up to right now.">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:8px">// what I'm up to</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Now</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">Updated {updated} · <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--text3);font-size:0.82rem">What is a now page?</a></p>
  </div>

  <div style="max-width:620px" class="fade-in">

    <section class="now-section">
      <h2 class="now-heading">Building</h2>
      <p>Turning <strong>ant.cat</strong> into something alive — migrating 20 years of writing from WordPress and building small AI-powered experiments in public. The <a href="/experiments">experiments page</a> is where the new work lives: currently hacking on Three.js shaders, volumetric CRT projection beams, and how local LLMs and agent frameworks fit into everyday product prototyping.</p>
      <p>By day, leading product strategy for enterprise workforce platforms at LotusOne / Aya Healthcare.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="now-section">
      <h2 class="now-heading">Reading</h2>
      <p>Working through my backlog. Always have three books going at once and finish none of them on schedule — usually toggling between behavioral economics, decision architecture (pre-mortems and kill-criteria), biographies, and the theology of work.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="now-section">
      <h2 class="now-heading">Thinking about</h2>
      <p>What it means to build software when it's become as easy as a prompt and it's as simple as an email or Excel file. Most software is designed for recurring use: retention, habit, the returning user. But some of the most meaningful and helpful things only happen once.</p>
      <p>Also: time perception and the half-life of knowledge. Once you pass your <a href="/writing/32-doublings/">32nd doubling</a>, cumulative value matters far more than urgent friction. Software should help us feel more creative and more human without anything more.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="now-section">
      <h2 class="now-heading">Life</h2>
      <p>Based in Jacksonville Beach, Florida. Loving my partner, Samantha, and life. Keeping up with my 5-year-old daughter and navigating kindergarten milestones. Pretend to be a surfer when the swell cooperates, daily workouts, and keeping my 1997 Jeep TJ running clean. Learning upright bass, focusing on finger-plucking rhythm and walking jazz blues lines. Finding that the best ideas still come from building things vs what if'ing them to death.</p>
    </section>

    <div style="margin-top:48px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
      <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.68rem;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:0.04em">
        This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--text3)">now page</a>. 
        If you have one too, <a href="mailto:ranthonycatanese@gmail.com" style="color:var(--accent)">send it to me</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <CouchFooter />
</Base>

<style>
.now-section { margin-bottom: 36px; }
.now-heading {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.now-section p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 0.8em; }
.now-section a { color: var(--accent); }
.now-section strong { color: var(--text); }
</style>
